Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:58:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] opstack-server: serve heads from a verified directory of
 Base v4 gossip objects

--objects-dir ingests write-once <sha256>.v4.snappy envelopes produced by an
external listener on the maintained base-consensus-gossip crate; each file must
be named by its content hash and recover to the pinned signer. --no-gossip
leaves head production to that listener. Tests use a real Base mainnet gossip
object (block 52965074) as a public vector.
